# Backups created by the patch scripts
*.orig

# OS / editor cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp

# Personal/local notes — the ".local.md" convention stays out of git
# (CLAUDE.local.md, audience-rules.local.md, etc.)
*.local.md

# OpenSpec CLI scaffolding — regenerated on every `openspec` run. The interactive
# /opsx:* commands and openspec-* skills were deliberately removed from this repo
# (see CLAUDE.md), so keep the CLI's re-emitted copies out of git. Scoped to those
# namespaces so a hand-authored command/skill under .claude/ is still trackable.
.claude/commands/opsx/
.claude/skills/openspec-*/
# ...and the empty lockfile `npx @fission-ai/openspec` drops at the repo root
# (this repo has no package.json — it is not an npm project).
/package-lock.json
